{"id":"6723a6e09cfa1b3f","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-stable-homotopy.md","title":"Stable Homotopy","display":"df-stable-homotopy — Stable Homotopy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stable-homotopy","aliases":["58-df-stable-homotopy"],"display":"df-stable-homotopy — Stable Homotopy","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-suspension.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stable-homotopy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stable-homotopy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stable-homotopy — Stable Homotopy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b387299f5e4dd383\" href=\"?note=b387299f5e4dd383\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-suspension.md\">../batch08/58-df-suspension.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" href=\"?note=cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md\">../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c7e703f871c9421\" href=\"?note=9c7e703f871c9421\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md\">../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c682c089b3ac3182\" href=\"?note=c682c089b3ac3182\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md\">../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,x_0),(Y,y_0)\">\\((X,x_0),(Y,y_0)\\)</span> (pointed CW complexes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9c7e703f871c9421\" href=\"?note=9c7e703f871c9421\" title=\"58-df-cw-complex\">58-df-cw-complex</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (reduced suspension, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b387299f5e4dd383\" href=\"?note=b387299f5e4dd383\" title=\"58-df-suspension\">58-df-suspension</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X,Y]_{*}\">\\([X,Y]_{*}\\)</span> (based homotopy classes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" href=\"?note=cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" title=\"58-df-homotopy\">58-df-homotopy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span> (degree)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_n\\coloneqq[\\Sigma^nX,\\Sigma^nY]_{*}\">\\(H_n\\coloneqq[\\Sigma^nX,\\Sigma^nY]_{*}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_n:H_n\\to H_{n+1}\">\\(\\sigma_n:H_n\\to H_{n+1}\\)</span> (map induced by reduced suspension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_n^k\\coloneqq\\pi_{k+n}(\\Sigma^nY,y_n)\">\\(G_n^k\\coloneqq\\pi_{k+n}(\\Sigma^nY,y_n)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_n^k:G_n^k\\to G_{n+1}^k\">\\(s_n^k:G_n^k\\to G_{n+1}^k\\)</span> (homotopy-group suspension map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{n,r}\">\\(\\sigma_{n,r}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{n,r}^k\">\\(s_{n,r}^k\\)</span> (the corresponding composites from stage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> to stage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>, with identity at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=n\">\\(r=n\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-coded function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}classes}\\vdash\nD_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\bigl(\\{n\\}\\times H_n\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\langle n,a\\rangle\\sim_{X,Y}\\langle m,b\\rangle\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle n,a\\rangle,\\langle m,b\\rangle\\in D_{X,Y}\\land\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n\\leq r\\land m\\leq r\n\\land\\sigma_{n,r}(a)=\\sigma_{m,r}(b)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;[X,Y]^S\\coloneqq D_{X,Y}/{\\sim_{X,Y}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}classes}\\vdash\nD_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\bigl(\\{n\\}\\times H_n\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\langle n,a\\rangle\\sim_{X,Y}\\langle m,b\\rangle\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle n,a\\rangle,\\langle m,b\\rangle\\in D_{X,Y}\\land\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n\\leq r\\land m\\leq r\n\\land\\sigma_{n,r}(a)=\\sigma_{m,r}(b)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;[X,Y]^S\\coloneqq D_{X,Y}/{\\sim_{X,Y}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}group}\\vdash\nn_0(k)\\coloneqq\\max(0,-k),\\qquad\nD_Y^k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega\\setminus n_0(k)}\\bigl(\\{n\\}\\times G_n^k\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\langle n,a\\rangle\\sim_Y^k\\langle m,b\\rangle\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle n,a\\rangle,\\langle m,b\\rangle\\in D_Y^k\\land\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n_0(k)\\leq n,m\\leq r\n\\land s_{n,r}^k(a)=s_{m,r}^k(b)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\pi_k^S(Y)\\coloneqq D_Y^k/{\\sim_Y^k}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}group}\\vdash\nn_0(k)\\coloneqq\\max(0,-k),\\qquad\nD_Y^k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega\\setminus n_0(k)}\\bigl(\\{n\\}\\times G_n^k\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\langle n,a\\rangle\\sim_Y^k\\langle m,b\\rangle\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle n,a\\rangle,\\langle m,b\\rangle\\in D_Y^k\\land\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n_0(k)\\leq n,m\\leq r\n\\land s_{n,r}^k(a)=s_{m,r}^k(b)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\pi_k^S(Y)\\coloneqq D_Y^k/{\\sim_Y^k}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two direct limits are expanded as quotients of disjoint unions by eventual equality under the suspension transition maps; hence the carrier and equivalence relation are set-coded.</li>\n<li>Each eventual-equality relation is explicitly restricted to its displayed disjoint-union carrier, so the quotient cannot acquire pairs from outside the direct system.</li>\n<li>The notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\setminus n_0(k)\">\\(\\omega\\setminus n_0(k)\\)</span> denotes the natural numbers at least <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_0(k)\">\\(n_0(k)\\)</span> because a natural number is identified with its set of predecessors.</li>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=S^0\">\\(Y=S^0\\)</span>, these are the stable homotopy groups of spheres.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-suspension.md","status":"resolved","id":"b387299f5e4dd383","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-suspension.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md","status":"resolved","id":"cc1ce993dd3ce56d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"9c7e703f871c9421","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"c682c089b3ac3182","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cw-complex","status":"resolved","id":"9c7e703f871c9421","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(X,x_0),(Y,y_0)$ (pointed CW complexes, see [[58-df-cw-complex]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-suspension","status":"resolved","id":"b387299f5e4dd383","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (reduced suspension, see [[58-df-suspension]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homotopy","status":"resolved","id":"cc1ce993dd3ce56d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[X,Y]_{*}$ (based homotopy classes, see [[58-df-homotopy]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-coded function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,x_0),(Y,y_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"[X,Y]_{*}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"H_n\\coloneqq[\\Sigma^nX,\\Sigma^nY]_{*}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_n:H_n\\to H_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"G_n^k\\coloneqq\\pi_{k+n}(\\Sigma^nY,y_n)","display":false},{"tex":"s_n^k:G_n^k\\to G_{n+1}^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_{n,r}","display":false},{"tex":"s_{n,r}^k","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"r=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}classes}\\vdash\nD_{X,Y}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\bigl(\\{n\\}\\times H_n\\bigr),\\\\\n&\\langle n,a\\rangle\\sim_{X,Y}\\langle m,b\\rangle\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle n,a\\rangle,\\langle m,b\\rangle\\in D_{X,Y}\\land\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n\\leq r\\land m\\leq r\n\\land\\sigma_{n,r}(a)=\\sigma_{m,r}(b)\\bigr),\\\\\n&[X,Y]^S\\coloneqq D_{X,Y}/{\\sim_{X,Y}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}group}\\vdash\nn_0(k)\\coloneqq\\max(0,-k),\\qquad\nD_Y^k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega\\setminus n_0(k)}\\bigl(\\{n\\}\\times G_n^k\\bigr),\\\\\n&\\langle n,a\\rangle\\sim_Y^k\\langle m,b\\rangle\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle n,a\\rangle,\\langle m,b\\rangle\\in D_Y^k\\land\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(n_0(k)\\leq n,m\\leq r\n\\land s_{n,r}^k(a)=s_{m,r}^k(b)\\bigr),\\\\\n&\\pi_k^S(Y)\\coloneqq D_Y^k/{\\sim_Y^k}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega\\setminus n_0(k)","display":false},{"tex":"n_0(k)","display":false},{"tex":"Y=S^0","display":false}],"bytes":2563,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1217","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-stable-homotopy.md|58-df-stable-homotopy]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["b387299f5e4dd383","cc1ce993dd3ce56d","9c7e703f871c9421","c682c089b3ac3182","36d7463d215be751"]}